Sample Gallery Structure

Flexible Height Gallery

Inside the gallery:


---

1. lbl_Title

Properties

Text = ThisItem.Title
FontWeight = FontWeight.Bold
Width = Parent.Width - 20
X = 10
Y = 10


---

2. lbl_Description

Properties

Text = ThisItem.Description
AutoHeight = true
Width = Parent.Width - 20
X = 10
Y = lbl_Title.Y + lbl_Title.Height + 5

This label expands automatically depending on text length.


---

3. lbl_Status (Example Control Below)

Properties

Text = "Completed"
X = 10
Y = lbl_Description.Y + lbl_Description.Height + 5

This automatically moves downward if the description becomes taller.


