---

Important Setting

Your gallery must be:

Flexible Height Gallery

NOT:

Vertical Gallery

because standard galleries cannot dynamically resize each row properly.


---

Common Mistake

If you use:

Height = 40

the text gets cut off.

Instead use:

AutoHeight = true

and allow the label to expand naturally.


