How to Build This Layout

Inside your Flexible Height Gallery:


---

Column 1 — Supplier Name

lbl_Supplier

Text = ThisItem.SupplierName
Width = 150
X = 0
Y = 10


---

Column 2 — Description

lbl_Description

Text = ThisItem.Description
AutoHeight = true
Width = Parent.Width - 170
X = 160
Y = 10

This is the important part:

AutoHeight = true

because it allows the row to grow.


---

Optional Divider Line

Rectangle or Separator

Y = lbl_Description.Y + lbl_Description.Height + 10
Height = 1
Width = Parent.Width

This creates a table-row appearance.


